          <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2.5 text-base text-slate-700 list-disc pl-5">
            <li>Broken root stump or badly decayed tooth that cannot hold a filling or cap.</li>
            <li>Painful or swollen gum around an emerging or sideways wisdom tooth.</li>
            <li>Very shaky tooth causing pain while chewing due to severe bone loss.</li>
            <li>Over-retained baby tooth blocking a permanent tooth in children.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
