              <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-slate-600">Every extraction comes with our 8-point English &amp; Hindi care guide covering cotton pad timing, soft food, and salt-water rinses.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <ol class="mt-5 space-y-3 text-base text-slate-700 list-decimal pl-5">
            <li><strong>Digital X-Ray &amp; Health Check:</strong> Dr. Shubham Gupta reviews your blood pressure, diabetes, or blood-thinner history and checks root shape on an X-ray.</li>
            <li><strong>Thorough Local Numbing:</strong> The tooth and surrounding gum are numbed completely before beginning.</li>
            <li><strong>Gentle Removal:</strong> Using sterile instruments, the tooth is loosened calmly and lifted out without excessive force.</li>
            <li><strong>Gauze &amp; Written Aftercare:</strong> You bite gently on sterile cotton for 1 hour and receive our bilingual English &amp; Hindi recovery instructions.</li>
          </ol>
