            <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-700 list-disc pl-5">
              <li>Eliminates stubborn pain and recurring gum swelling.</li>
              <li>Prevents infection from spreading to nearby teeth.</li>
              <li>Creates a healthy socket ready for future replacement if needed.</li>
