            <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-700 list-disc pl-5">
              <li>Remove the cotton pad after 1 hour and eat only cold, soft foods that day.</li>
              <li>From the next day, rinse gently with lukewarm salt water 3 times daily for 5 days.</li>
              <li>Avoid paan, bidi, cigarettes, and alcohol for 5 days (<a href="/aftercare.html" class="text-[#C1121F] font-semibold underline">see full bilingual guide</a>).</li>
            </ul>
